flag --cpuprofile arg=none | write cpu profile to this file
flag -d | display diffs instead of rewriting files
flag -e | report all errors (not just the first 10 on different lines)
flag -l | list files whose formatting differs from gofmt's
flag -r arg=none | rewrite rule (e.g., 'a[b:len(a)] -> a[b:]')
flag -s | simplify code
flag -w | write result to (source) file instead of stdout
